BiPOP V4/V5 – AI-Driven Immunotherapy Prediction Platform (FIVERR.)
Built a dual-stream ML framework using XGBoost, scikit-learn, Pandas, and NumPy to train 148+ immune-response prediction models with concordance scoring, developed a SciPy Differential Evolution engine for personalized therapy optimization, and deployed an interactive Flask web platform with multi-species datasets on Railway Cloud.
Tech Stack: Python, Flask, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, XGBoost, scikit-learn, Pandas, NumPy, SciPy, SHAP, Joblib, SQLite/CSV, Bootstrap, Railway Cloud


